    "extract": "The Pinacoteca metropolitana di Bari or Pinacoteca C. Giaquinto is a public gallery of paintings and museum of artworks in the city of Bari, Italy. The museum displays a range of artistic works connected to the region of Apulia.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Pinacoteca metropolitana di Bari</b> or <b>Pinacoteca C. Giaquinto</b> is a public gallery of paintings and museum of artworks in the city of Bari, Italy. The museum displays a range of artistic works connected to the region of Apulia.</p>",
